{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-About_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly\u2019s Meadow is a relaxing idle game that sits on your desktop - resize it and place it anywhere to create the perfect peaceful backdrop for your day. Enjoy the soothing sounds of nature, raking leaves, activities and original lo-fi tunes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Millys_Meadow_Raking.gif?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Customise_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and customise Milly's outfits to match your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/new-hat.gif?t=1749613880\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/customise-apparel.gif?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Decorate_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and decorate the meadow the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/customise-meadow.gif?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Activities.png?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add activities to your meadow for Milly to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/fish.gif?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/farming.gif?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Work_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly's Meadow sits on top (or behind) your applications while you work or unwind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/while-working-or-playing.gif?t=1749613880\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3063730?t=1749613880","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/4bb71c4eafc95c584d4cee4b8563deb6f647dcc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749613880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/8fdd099e3e86cf663e2a07943b4d285b025ce997/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749613880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/8fdd099e3e86cf663e2a07943b4d285b025ce997/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749613880","categories":[{"description":"Single-pl